{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27627","headline":"题杭州天竺寺 · 张祜","name":"题杭州天竺寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西南山最胜，一界是诸天。\n上路穿岩竹，分流入寺泉。\n蹑云丹井畔，望月石桥边。\n洞壑江声远，楼台海气连。\n塔明春岭雪，钟散暮松烟。\n何处去犹恨，更看峰顶莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}